      "content": "but exhaustion implies there's a way to recover, you know? like sleep or rest or something. it's not that. it feels more like being a shattered glass. no matter how much you try to glue it back together, the cracks are always there and it never holds water again. i'm just tired of trying to be \"whole\" when it's clearly impossible.",
