    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so much work to even \"set the pieces down.\" even existing feels like a constant, exhausting effort to keep things from falling apart. sometimes i look at the mess i am and i just think... why even bother? if it's never going to be right, maybe it's just better to stop fighting it. maybe it's okay to just let go.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
